<title>USA: Track Data Corp Q4 shr loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Track Data Corp Q4 shr loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>FINANCIAL HIGHLIGHTS</p>
<p>		    Three Months Ended		Year Ended</p>
<p>			 December 31,		   December 31,</p>
<p>		   1996	    1995	    1996	  1995</p>
<p> Revenues  $11,965,000   $10,893,000  $47,139,000  $44,524,000</p>
<p>Net (loss) income</p>
<p>	    (488,000)a (3,632,000)b,e  62,000(c)  (5,511,000)d,e</p>
